    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "58_g1_yusrestaurant",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "key": "$midautumn",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You... You know everything?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4172_xingzh_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I only just found out...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ning Yin"
    },
    {
        "text": "I still want to ask you\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ning Yin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "How are you... so calm about all this...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4172_xingzh_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was a suspicion I hid away in my heart for many, many years... One I have finally found proof for.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ning Yin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Like a thorn stuck in your palm. It may bleed a bit when you pluck it out, but you'll feel much better afterward.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ning Yin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4172_xingzh_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ning Yin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why won't you say something?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ning Yin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know how it came to all this...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Should I feel sad or angry right now...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know... All I know is that my mind's a mess and my heart feels like it's being stabbed... Who the hell am I supposed to set ablaze with this fire crawling up my throat?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4172_xingzh_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, I have a question for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ning Yin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Blaze... Can you tell me about Gu Quan? My... my father. What sort of man was he?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ning Yin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "He... He was an idiot, a nerd, and a liar!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hate lies! I've seen too damn many of them! Greedy lies, cowardly lies, sneaky lies...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "But never one that demanded a lifetime of commitment, one that cost him his own daughter and himself, all to protect someone who had nothing to do with him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "How... How could he be so stupid?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4172_xingzh_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "It reminds me of a story I once read...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ning Yin"
    },
    {
        "text": "There once was a guard who watched over a rest station by the river. One day, he saw a flood coming from upstream. He wanted to run upstream and tell the people there to close the sluice gates.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ning Yin"
    },
    {
        "text": "But he had only run halfway when he saw the river was rising too quickly. It was too late to close the gates. So he immediately decided to turn and warn the villagers downstream to flee.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ning Yin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4172_xingzh_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Back and forth he ran, until finally he was consumed and swept away by the flood. He didn't manage to do anything or save anyone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ning Yin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get to the point already...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4172_xingzh_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Would you... Would you say this man's deeds sound familiar?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ning Yin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine, I get it! Well, I don't really get all the details of your windy-ass story, but you're talking shit about him, aren't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "He wasn't a bad guy, okay?! He was just... Urgh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know you've got good reasons to blame him, duh, but if he was the one who threw you away, why would he spend so much time coming back to look for you\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4172_xingzh_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought I would be the one consoling you, not the other way around...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ning Yin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Blaze... You're infected, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ning Yin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, when did you figure that out\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Man, you're too... you're too damn clever by half!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4172_xingzh_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, I didn't mean anything untoward... I was just thinking that it really should have been my fate to be...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ning Yin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The hell are you even talking about?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "What? You think you've done something wrong and deserve a worse fate?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please, my life is awesome. I've got lots of buddies, and I've found a dream of mine...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "If anything, you're the one who got it bad! Growing up all by yourself in that big old mansion, alone and miserable.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4172_xingzh_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "It almost sounds like you're roasting me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ning Yin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I understand... I understand what you mean.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ning Yin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4172_xingzh_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, right... I still haven't asked you what your name actually is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ning Yin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Zhuhuang... Gu Zhuhuang. It's the name Dad... he gave me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wow... I forget how long it's been since I last told someone my real name.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, that's it. That's the last of my secrets.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4172_xingzh_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "'A blazing candle to ward against the dark'... Zhu for a candle, Huang for a blaze, and the family name Gu to ward you. It really does sound like a name he would pick.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ning Yin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4172_xingzh_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Blaze... Would you say I've only really gotten to know you now, after all this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ning Yin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I guess so, yeah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, no, I've still got lots to tell you, and I need to bring you to Victoria to have a look around. My mom\u2014err, or rather... your birth mother. You should probably go see her...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4172_xingzh_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...She's still alive?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ning Yin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who said she was dead?! She's still hale and hearty! She lives in a small town out in western Victoria.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Once everything's wrapped up here, I'll take you to her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sh-She definitely wants to see you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4172_xingzh_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "A-Alright...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ning Yin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why're you crying?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4172_xingzh_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I-I'm not...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ning Yin"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you... You're the one who's about to break into tears any second now...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ning Yin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm just... happy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "I never thought I'd suddenly find myself a little sister after all these years.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4172_xingzh_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who's ever heard of sisters like us...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ning Yin"
    },
    {
        "text": "And besides, we don't know yet who's the little one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ning Yin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've been through a lot today. Can't you let me have this one?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4172_xingzh_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "And there you were, consoling me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ning Yin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look, I just wanted to say...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "From now on, you're not alone anymore, okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
