        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Man... Isn't that lovely?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#18$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Out of the myriad flavors in this land, the taste of reunion is the sweetest of them all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Really, now... Dammit, what am I tearing up for...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#18$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's the last of my worries settled.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4172_xingzh_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, right, that Judicial officer at the Forbidden City last night...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ning Yin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Leizi...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "She was being held up by that Imperial Guard lady when she sent me flying out of the City.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4172_xingzh_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What should we do now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ning Yin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "This isn't over quite yet...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "I need to go and finish off what I should have done in the first place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4172_xingzh_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You... What are you planning to do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ning Yin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Demand an explanation... for everyone's sake.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.2,
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
