    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#2$2",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1621_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where you off to?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jiang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Got a meal to deliver.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1621_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you're going, then who's going to mind the restaurant?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jiang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#2$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "At this hour? It's past closing time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1621_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gonna open tomorrow?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jiang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#3$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "That depends on my mood tomorrow. Hard to say right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1621_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why do I get the feeling that you want to call it quits?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jiang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1621_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine by me, but you still owe me six months of wages. Settle that and I'll let you go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jiang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#11$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tsch... You're so money-minded! How about all those staff meals I cooked for you, they must be worth a few months of debt...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#14$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine, fine... On the right of the stove in the kitchen, the third brick from the corner. The last of my spare cash is under that brick. Take it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1621_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jiang"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've been with you for quite a few years now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jiang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yep, fifteen whole years. You've stuck around the longest out of all your associates, Candleholder. Means we were really fated to be, haha.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1621_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I kept reminding myself that I was a Candleholder of the Sui Regulator, I'm afraid I wouldn't have stayed that long.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jiang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh* To be honest, it's been years since I reminded myself who I really am too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not like I was trying to remember or not, mind you. Whether as a man or beast, I've found this life full of delightful flavors. Nothing to complain about.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1621_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Best you keep not remembering.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jiang"
    },
    {
        "text": "I fear if you do, you'll forget the tastes of man. Your palate will grow dull and numb, and your cooking skills will go to waste.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jiang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#13$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh*... Yeah, I wouldn't be too happy with that either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "But if there's one thing I'll never forget, it's that my trouble-making brothers and sisters still need to eat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not to mention the one that's most troublesome of all... Though considering how long it's been since we last saw each other, it's hard to say what he's like now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1621_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know the consequences of delivering this particular meal today, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jiang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#4$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh... Yeah, more or less.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's obvious, like not keeping cotton by the stove. The Sui Regulator's not going to be happy if we have a family reunion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "text": "Also, if a fight breaks out at such a delicate moment, you might not be seeing me tomorrow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1621_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jiang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh*... I've made a lot of food and met a lot of people these past few years.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "text": "My wish was for every customer who walks through those doors to have a tasty meal and a life with fewer regrets.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#7$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "The four flavors of the kitchen. The four emotions of the heart. Sorrowful partings and joyful reunions. They're not that much different.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "text": "But just as fresh fins have their bones and maluses have no scent, this land is filled with regrets.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eat when you're hungry, sleep when you're tired... and when you miss your family, maybe it's as simple as going to them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1621_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are... Are you really willing to let this go...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jiang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#18$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "There are a lot of things I don't want to let go of, but I can't hold onto them forever either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Jiang... Mind looking after the shop for me while I'm gone?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've been watching me cook for so long, you must have picked something up by now. If any customers come by, look after them for me, will you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#18$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Savors at Yu's', the 'House of Aftertaste'... It ended up being a fitting name.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yu"
    },
    {
        "text": "The mortal realm really lingers on the tongue.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yu"
    },
    {
