    },
    {
        "text": "Good, you've saved me the effort of searching the entire city for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Junior Drillmaster"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't care if you want to take me in for what I did at the Feast or who I am... Now's not the time for it.",
